@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@apiKey = lectura-abierta-basic-key

### ===================================================
### 0. MONITOREO Y SALUD DEL SISTEMA (ENTREGABLE D3)
### ===================================================

### [EXITOSA] Comprobación de salud y conexión activa a SQLite (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### ===================================================
### 1. AUTENTICACIÓN: REGISTRO Y LOGIN
### ===================================================

### Requisito: `npm run db:seed` crea admin@lecturaabierta.com / Admin123!
### El registro público ya NO acepta `rol`: siempre crea un LECTOR.

### 1.1 [FALSA / ERROR] Intento de autoregistrarse como ADMIN (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Intento Escalada",
  "email": "escalada@lecturaabierta.com",
  "password": "Password123*",
  "rol": "ADMIN"
}

### 1.2 Registro de Lector Estándar (siempre rol LECTOR) (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Carlos Lector",
  "email": "carlos.lector@lecturaabierta.com",
  "password": "Password123*"
}

### 1.3 Login Administrador -> Obtiene tokens
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@lecturaabierta.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Variables extraídas de la respuesta del Administrador
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@adminRefreshToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.refreshToken}}

### 1.4 Login Lector Estándar -> Obtiene token
# @name loginLector
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos.lector@lecturaabierta.com",
  "password": "Password123*"
}

### Variable extraída de la respuesta del Lector
@lectorToken = {{loginLector.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 1.5 [FALSA / ERROR] Login con contraseña errónea (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@lecturaabierta.com",
  "password": "ClaveIncorrecta123*"
}

### 1.6 [EXITOSA] Refrescar Access Token usando Refresh Token (200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{adminRefreshToken}}"
}

### 1.7 [FALSA / ERROR] Refrescar con Refresh Token corrupto (403 Forbidden o 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "token-invalido-o-expirado"
}

### ===================================================
### 2. CARGA DE CATÁLOGOS BASE (REQUISITOS PREVIOS)
### ===================================================

### 2.1 Crear Categoría de prueba (ADMIN)
# @name crearCategoria
POST {{baseUrl}}/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Literatura Latinoamericana",
  "descripcion": "Obras clásicas del realismo mágico y narrativa regional"
}

### 2.2 Crear Autor de prueba (ADMIN)
# @name crearAutor
POST {{baseUrl}}/autores
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Gabriel García Márquez",
  "nacionalidad": "Colombiana"
}

### 2.3 Crear Sede de biblioteca (ADMIN)
# @name crearSede
POST {{baseUrl}}/sedes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Sede Central Riohacha",
  "ciudad": "Riohacha",
  "direccion": "Calle 1 # 1-01"
}

### 2.4 Crear Libro de prueba vinculado a Autor y Categoría (ADMIN)
# @name crearLibro
POST {{baseUrl}}/libros
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Cien Años de Soledad",
  "isbn": "978-0307474728",
  "ejemplaresDisponibles": 5,
  "categoriaId": 1,
  "autorId": 1
}

### ===================================================
### 3. NIVEL 1: SIN AUTENTICACIÓN (PÚBLICO)
### ===================================================

### [EXITOSA] Lectores: Catálogo público sin credenciales (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lectores/publico
Accept: application/json

### [EXITOSA] Préstamos: Estadísticas públicas sin credenciales (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prestamos/estadisticas-publicas
Accept: application/json

### ===================================================
### 4. NIVEL 2: SOLO AUTENTICACIÓN BÁSICA (x-api-key)
### ===================================================

### [FALSA / ERROR] Lectores: Petición sin cabecera x-api-key (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lectores/autenticado-basico
Accept: application/json

### [EXITOSA] Lectores: Petición con x-api-key válida (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lectores/autenticado-basico
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### [FALSA / ERROR] Préstamos: Resumen interno sin cabecera (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prestamos/resumen-interno
Accept: application/json

### [EXITOSA] Préstamos: Resumen interno con x-api-key válida (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prestamos/resumen-interno
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### ===================================================
### 5. NIVEL 3: AUTENTICACIÓN JWT BEARER
### ===================================================

### [FALSA / ERROR] Préstamos: Consulta general sin cabecera Authorization (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prestamos
Accept: application/json

### [EXITOSA] Préstamos: Consulta general con JWT Bearer de Lector (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prestamos
Authorization: Bearer {{lectorToken}}
Accept: application/json

### [EXITOSA] Lectores: Consulta con JWT Bearer de Lector (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lectores/jwt
Authorization: Bearer {{lectorToken}}
Accept: application/json

### [EXITOSA] Préstamos: Consulta general con JWT Bearer de Administrador (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prestamos
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ===================================================
### 6. NIVEL 4: JWT + RBAC (ROLES ADMIN vs LECTOR)
### ===================================================

### 6.1 Control de Acceso sobre Entidad LECTORES

### [FALSA / ERROR] Lector intenta registrar un nuevo lector (403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lectores
Authorization: Bearer {{lectorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Intento Denegado por Rol"
}

### [EXITOSA] Administrador registra un nuevo lector (201 Created)
# @name nuevoLector
POST {{baseUrl}}/lectores
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Álvaro Cepeda Samudio",
  "descripcion": "Periodista y escritor"
}

### 6.2 Control de Acceso sobre Entidad PRÉSTAMOS

### [FALSA / ERROR] Lector intenta autorizar/crear un préstamo directamente (403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/prestamos
Authorization: Bearer {{lectorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lectorId": 1,
  "ejemplarId": 1,
  "fechaFin": "2026-11-15T00:00:00Z"
}

### [EXITOSA] Administrador autoriza y registra el préstamo (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/prestamos
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lectorId": 1,
  "ejemplarId": 1,
  "fechaFin": "2026-11-20T00:00:00Z"
}

### 7. DEMO EVALUACION: NUEVO ROL (BIBLIOTECARIO), USUARIO Y FLUJO BUSINESS
### Crear un usuario con rol privilegiado: solo ADMIN, vía /api/usuarios
POST {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "andres",
  "nombre": "Andres Gomez Fuentes",
  "email": "andres.biblio@lecturaabierta.com",
  "password": "Password123*",
  "rol": "BIBLIOTECARIO"
}